            <ArticleTitle>Pain in the scrotum.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>101-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The symptom of pain in the scrotum is one that can occupy a large amount of a doctor's time and compromise his credibility with the patient. This need not be if he understands the physiology of pain production in the scrotum, and follows simple management guidelines.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
